; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Det\Det.c	   961       \COUNTERMEASURE \S The DET should not be in production code. 
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Det\Det.c	   962        If it is used the extended debug features should be switched off because they are only relevant if a debugger is attached. 
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Det\Det.c	   963        All of the above listed array write accesses occur only if extended debug features are enabled. SMI-60
